WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.600
It's easy to think sleep is time you lose.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.900
One more video.

3
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.900
One more hour.

4
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.900
One more thing to finish.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:25.800
But while you sleep, your brain is still working.

6
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.600
In deep sleep, slow waves of fluid wash through your brain.

7
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.800
Scientists think this helps clear away the day.

8
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.900
So you can meet the morning as someone new.

9
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.800
Tonight, put the phone down a little earlier.

10
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.600
Sleep isn't time you lose.

11
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
It's how you begin again.

12
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.000
Tonight: phone down 30 minutes before bed.
